</tr>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Heading</p>
</td>
<td class="gallery-item-heading" style="width: 50%;">
<h3 style="margin: 1.5em 0px 0px;"><a href="{{f:84003284}}">STRATEGIC PRIORITY: LEAD IN STUDENT SUCCESS, ACCESS AND CAREER READINESS</a></h3>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Text</p>
</td>
<td class="gallery-item-text" style="width: 50%;">
<p style="font-size: 16px; color: #000000;">Establish the college as a national model for AI, cybersecurity and computing education through future-ready curricula that adapt quickly to technological change and ensure every graduate is career-ready.&nbsp;</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
