<p>Heading Display. Accepted values: yes, no</p>
</td>
<td class="gallery-item-heading-display" style="width: 50%;" data-select-list="yes, no">yes</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Heading</p>
</td>
<td class="gallery-item-heading" style="width: 50%;">
<h3 style="margin: 1.5em 0px 0px;"><a style="text-underline-offset: 4px;" href="{{f:84003281}}">STRATEGIC PRIORITY: STRENGTHEN FACULTY CAPACITY AND RESEARCH IN AI AND CYBERSECURITY</a></h3>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Text</p>
</td>
<td class="gallery-item-text" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Elevate USF&rsquo;s status as a top-tier institution in AI and Cybersecurity research by recruiting world-class faculty and building an agile, resilient, and ambitious collaborative research culture.&nbsp;</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Image</p>
</td>
<td class="gallery-item-image" style="width: 50%;"><img style="font-size: 16px; color: #000000;" src="{{f:84042721}}" alt="Faculty Capacity" width="320" height="213" /></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
