</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>
<table class="gallery-text-image">
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable" colspan="2">Gallery Item - Text and Image <br />Image Dimensions - Width: 460 px, Height: 300 px* <br />* Recommended height.</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Heading Display. Accepted values: yes, no</p>
</td>
<td class="gallery-item-heading-display" style="width: 50%;" data-select-list="yes, no">yes</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Heading</p>
</td>
<td class="gallery-item-heading" style="width: 50%;">
<h3><a href="{{f:84003283}}">STRATEGIC PRIORITY: INDUSTRY AND OPERATIONAL EXCELLENCE</a></h3>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Text</p>
</td>
<td class="gallery-item-text" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Establish Bellini College as a financially robust, operationally elite, and industry-integrated engine. This goal ensures long-term viability through optimized infrastructure, including computing and efficient operations, while serving as the primary talent pipeline for Florida&rsquo;s tech economy, targeting the "Professional, Scientific, and Technical Services" and "Manufacturing" sectors from the BOG&rsquo;s Iconic Companies list.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Image</p>
</td>
<td class="gallery-item-image" style="width: 50%;"><img src="{{f:84042717}}" alt="Industry and Operational Excellence" width="490" height="328" /></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Image Alignment. Accepted values: left, right</p>
</td>
<td class="gallery-item-alignment" style="width: 50%;" data-select-list="left, right">left</td>
