</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Heading Display. Accepted values: yes, no</p>
</td>
<td class="gallery-item-heading-display" style="width: 50%;" data-select-list="yes, no">yes</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Heading</p>
</td>
<td class="gallery-item-heading" style="width: 50%;">
<h3 style="margin: 1.5em 0px 0px;"><a href="{{f:84003282}}">STRATEGIC PRIORITY: EXPAND THE "HUB AND SPOKE" ACADEMIC ECOSYSTEM</a></h3>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Text</p>
</td>
<td class="gallery-item-text" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Democratize computing education across the university, connecting the technical "Hub" with multidisciplinary "Spokes" to increase enrollment and interdisciplinary competence.&nbsp;</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="ou-help mceNonEditable" style="width: 50%;">
<p>Image</p>
</td>
