<tr>
<td>
<h3>Turning Strategy Into Action&nbsp;</h3>
<p>The Bellini College strategic plan is a living framework supported by annual reviews, KPI dashboards, accountable ownership and continuous engagement with stakeholders. Progress will be measured through academic, research, operational and economic impact outcomes.&nbsp;</p>
<table class="two-column-text">
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable" width="50%">Column 1</th>
<th class="ou-help mceNonEditable" width="50%">Column 2</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>
<h4>Our Process&nbsp;</h4>
<p>The strategic planning process was collaborative, data-informed, and action-oriented. Beginning with SWOT analyses and stakeholder engagement, the plan was refined through leadership review, KPI development, advisory board input, implementation planning and public feedback. The result is a shared vision for advancing artificial intelligence, cybersecurity and computing at USF.&nbsp;</p>
</td>
<td>
<h4>Strategic Planning Timeline&nbsp;</h4>
<p><strong>Phase 1:</strong> Discovery and Synthesis (Aug-Dec 2025)&nbsp;<br /><strong>Phase 2:</strong> Metrics and Leadership Alignment (Jan 2026)&nbsp;<br /><strong>Phase 3:</strong> Unit Commitments and Governance (Feb 2026)&nbsp;<br /><strong>Phase 4:</strong> Execution Design (Mar 2026)&nbsp;<br /><strong>Phase 5:</strong> Publication and Adoption (Apr 2026)&nbsp;</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
